      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LinkedIn AI Job Hunter v2\n\n**Setup checklist**\n1. Credentials: Google Drive, Google Sheets, Telegram, plus 2 HTTP creds: *Header Auth* (name `Authorization`, value = `Bearer sk_...` Pollinations key from enter.pollinations.ai) and *Query Auth* (name `token`, value = Apify token). Assign them on the 2 Pollinations nodes and the Apify node.\n2. Edit the **Config** node (CV file id, Sheet, limits, phone, paths). Keep `dry_run = true` until a full test looks good.\n3. Google Sheet tab `Jobs` with header row: job_url, title, company, score, status, reason, note, date\n4. Search node: set your Apify LinkedIn Jobs actor id and map field names in *Pick New Jobs* if the actor uses different ones.\n5. Settings > Error workflow: select THIS workflow so the Error Trigger alert fires.\n6. Self-hosted n8n only: allow Execute Command (remove `n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand` from NODES_EXCLUDE), install `apply-linkedin.js` in `bot_dir`, run `--login` once.\n\n**Flow:** CV > AI profile > Apify search > dedupe > AI score + cover letter > log > top N above min_score > Playwright apply (or dry run) > status update + Telegram.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
